(                                PREFACE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In accordance with the scope of the series of Books on Business, of) Tj T*
(which this little work forms an item, its main object is to explain to) Tj T*
(the unversed in simple terms the somewhat complicated machinery of the) Tj T*
(Stock Exchange. Some criticism is ventured upon here and there, and a) Tj T*
(practical hint may be gleaned now and again from its pages; but the real) Tj T*
(aim of the book is merely to explain, not to comment. If the book) Tj T*
(conveys some idea of the important part the Stock Exchange plays in the) Tj T*
ET
