(clerks loitering about the already congested markets. They are badged) Tj T*
(and forbidden to loiter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is as one of these clerks that a candidate for membership can qualify) Tj T*
(for admission on the special terms we have indicated. If the applicant) Tj T*
(has served as a clerk for four years, with a minimum service in the) Tj T*
