(practically the end of his career, and probably ruin. Or its fiat may go) Tj T*
(forth in mild protest against smoking in the House a few minutes before) Tj T*
(the regulation time, or, as the temptations of the 5th of November) Tj T*
(approach, appealing to members to desist from firework displays in the) Tj T*
(House. With the Committee, of course, rest the admission and re-election) Tj T*
(of members. It decides whether the House shall be closed on any day) Tj T*
(except the usual holidays--there is always the excuse of structural) Tj T*
(alterations, and, as everyone knows, building operations can be carried) Tj T*
(on much more readily on a fine summer Saturday than during the dark) Tj T*
(frosts of winter. It decides all disputes between members; arbitration) Tj T*
(amongst the members themselves is encouraged, but they frequently refer) Tj T*
(to the Committee as a last resort. From its decision there is no appeal.) Tj T*
(To have recourse to the law courts without the permission of the) Tj T*
(Committee--which is, of course, granted in special cases--probably means) Tj T*
(the loss of membership by the member, who at the very outset undertakes) Tj T*
(to submit absolutely to the Committee and its rules. The Committee may) Tj T*
(summon any member before it and demand information; its power is) Tj T*
(inquisitorial. It fixes the days of settlement of the various) Tj T*
(transactions which take place in the market, and it decides what stocks) Tj T*
(or shares shall or shall not be quoted in the Official Price List, which) Tj T*
(emanates daily from the Stock Exchange under the Committee's) Tj T*
(superintendence. The principal officers of the Stock Exchange) Tj T*
(responsible to the Committee are its Secretary, the Secretary of the) Tj T*
(Share and Loan Department, the Official Assignee, the Deputy Official) Tj T*
(Assignee, the Manager of the Settlement Department, and the Manager of) Tj T*
(the Buying-In and Selling-Out Department. The nature of their duties) Tj T*
(will become clear as we proceed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Thus it will be seen the Stock Exchange is governed under a system of) Tj T*
(dual control--that of the Managers representing the proprietors on the) Tj T*
(one hand, and that of the Committee representing the members on the) Tj T*
(other. It is the system of a proprietary club. In its efforts for the) Tj T*
(good order and government of the House, the Committee has no funds that) Tj T*
(it can expend. It may make representation to the Managers, but it can do) Tj T*
(no more; although there is every sign that the Managers are always) Tj T*
(reasonably willing to accede to these representations. At the time of) Tj T*
(the imposition upon unauthorised clerks of those badges of which mention) Tj T*
(has been made, there was much delay in issuing them, and the story went) Tj T*
