(once buy or sell any one of the thousands of securities ranging from) Tj T*
(Consols down to Klondyke mining shares, but also by the fact that they) Tj T*
(perform many services of a somewhat intricate and technical nature) Tj T*
(connected with the buying and the selling. Transfers of inscribed stock) Tj T*
(have to be explained, and the client has to be identified at the bank,) Tj T*
(share certificates have to be obtained and delivered, arrangements have) Tj T*
(to be made for carrying over shares when a client does not desire to pay) Tj T*
(for them at the time of settlement, other detailed duties of the kind) Tj T*
(have to be performed, and, above all, the broker is frequently called) Tj T*
(upon to give expert advice as to investments and speculations, and to) Tj T*
(keep the client informed as to when to buy or sell. It may take days of) Tj T*
(watchfulness and inquiry to execute a single order when the client fixes) Tj T*
(a limit, that is, when he gives an order to purchase not above a certain) Tj T*
(price, or to sell not below a certain price.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
