(received; for British and other Corporation stocks and Colonial) Tj T*
(Government securities and for American and foreign railroad bonds, 5_s._) Tj T*
(per cent. on the nominal value; for foreign Government bonds the rate is) Tj T*
(2_s._ 6_d._ on the nominal value; for railway ordinary and deferred) Tj T*
(ordinary stocks the rate varies from 1/16 per cent. on the nominal value) Tj T*
