(to the member from whom he made the purchase a ticket bearing the amount) Tj T*
(and name of the security bought; the name, address, and description of) Tj T*
(the transferee, that is, the buying member's client, the price, and the) Tj T*
(date and the name of the member to whom the ticket is issued. This) Tj T*
(ticket is really a demand for the due delivery of the securities) Tj T*
(purchased. Now it often happens that the member to whom this ticket is) Tj T*
