(option, the right to sell, he would probably have to pay about 10_s._) Tj T*
(per cent. If at the end of next month, when the option has to be) Tj T*
(declared, Consols have fallen to 71, he can obtain his г10,000 worth for) Tj T*
(г7,100, and exercise his option to sell them for г7,300, thus making a) Tj T*
(profit of г200 less the г50 he paid for the option and the broker's) Tj T*
(commission of about г12 10_s._ The utmost he could lose by the) Tj T*
(transaction would be the г50 plus commission paid for the option, which) Tj T*
(he would, of course, not have exercised if the price movement had not) Tj T*
