(It has been seen that the Stock Exchange is a market, of which the wares) Tj T*
(are stocks and shares. There is some considerable difference, however,) Tj T*
(between stocks and shares, and there are various kinds of stocks and) Tj T*
(various kinds of shares. It may be interesting and profitable to inquire) Tj T*
