(Managers. The Committee is thus the editor of the List, and is) Tj T*
(responsible for the accuracy of the prices and other particulars which) Tj T*
(it collects and sets forth. The List is an imposing publication of) Tj T*
(sixteen closely printed pages, and contains the names of over four) Tj T*
(thousand securities. It is issued at about 5 o'clock each evening \(about) Tj T*
(2 o'clock on Saturdays\) and gives the prices at 3.30 \(1 o'clock on) Tj T*
(Saturdays\). The annual subscription for the List is г4, exclusive of) Tj T*
(postage, and single copies cost sixpence each. Long before the time of) Tj T*
(publication, every day there may be seen outside the offices a motley) Tj T*
(queue of commissionaires, clerks, and office-boys waiting for the copies) Tj T*
(as they are delivered from the press.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
