(status to other stocks and shares which are not so quoted; but the fact) Tj T*
(remains that official quotation does, undoubtedly, endow a security with) Tj T*
(a certain prestige. There is always some kind of market in securities) Tj T*
(quoted, and it is more easy to borrow upon them at the banks; whereas it) Tj T*
