(it never became law. Another attack on the status of the Stock Exchange) Tj T*
(was made in 1821, this time from inside. The Committee made an attempt) Tj T*
(to abolish option dealing; it actually forbade it by rule; whereupon) Tj T*
(many members, finding their occupation gone, subscribed money for the) Tj T*
