(During the past decade there have been far-reaching changes in the) Tj T*
(constitution and practice of the institution. With the object of) Tj T*
(gradually abolishing the dual control of members and proprietors, a rule) Tj T*
(requiring new members to purchase one or more shares was enacted; a) Tj T*
(long-standing bone of contention between jobbers and brokers was removed) Tj T*
(by rules more clearly defining and separating their functions; and the) Tj T*
(vexed question of brokers' commissions has led at last to the) Tj T*
(establishment of a minimum scale, with the object of preventing) Tj T*
(under-cutting by competitive firms. The long period of stagnation and) Tj T*
(depression was broken by the great rubber share boom of the spring of) Tj T*
(1910, when business reached proportions never before witnessed in the) Tj T*
(history of the Stock Exchange.) Tj T*
