(By half-past ten the work of the day is mapped out, the bargains of the) Tj T*
(previous day are in the checking book all ready for the unauthorised) Tj T*
(clerk to check, the transfers are being prepared for delivery or) Tj T*
(registration, the transfer receipts are run through to see what) Tj T*
