(check his bargains, while the partners begin to arrive on the scene.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Before the official hour of commencing business in the Stock Exchange) Tj T*
(has been duly announced by the old policemen's rattles sprung by the) Tj T*
(House waiters at a quarter to eleven o'clock, opening prices are already) Tj T*
(coming in from the markets, through the House clerks and the tape. The) Tj T*
(American quotations are, as a rule, more or less a matter of guesswork,) Tj T*
(and are based on the New York closing prices cabled from the other side;) Tj T*
(Home Railway lists are practically the same as those of the previous) Tj T*
(evening, and mining shares usually open as they were in the Street) Tj T*
(dealings of the night before. Thus it is on normal, ordinary days, but) Tj T*
(taking the House as a whole, there is generally some early change in the) Tj T*
(prices of some particular market caused by news contained in the morning) Tj T*
(papers. Perhaps the indefatigable locusts have been taking one of their) Tj T*
(excursion trips on one of the Argentine Rails, which causes the stocks) Tj T*
(in that section to droop; or perhaps a bumper traffic makes Grand Trunk) Tj T*
(securities advance in value; or it may be that a Mining Company has) Tj T*
(declared an unexpected dividend after hours on the preceding day, and) Tj T*
(the quotation for the shares is thereby affected. Each little detail of) Tj T*
(this description becomes magnified as the opening feature of each) Tj T*
(particular market, and the various items of news are telephoned or) Tj T*
(telegraphed to such clients as are interested in the stock itself, or in) Tj T*
(others of a similar group that may become affected by the information.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The first half-hour of the day, according to tradition, should be the) Tj T*
(busiest, because of the execution of orders that have come through the) Tj T*
(post; but if markets are moving sharply, the volume of business advances) Tj T*
(with the sun, as the changes become known all over London, the) Tj T*
(Provinces, Greater Britain, and the Continent. The swing of work is) Tj T*
(fairly under way soon after eleven o'clock. The office-boys and) Tj T*
(commissionaires are pursuing the tranquil round of transfer and) Tj T*
(certificate work; the unauthorised clerks are busily wiring long strings) Tj T*
(of prices by code to brokers and clients who are not on the spot; and) Tj T*
(the authorised clerks are engaged in the execution of orders, what time) Tj T*
(the partners interview clients in the office or attend to the more) Tj T*
(important business in the House themselves.) Tj T*
