(chief occupation consists in "having a look round," which means that he) Tj T*
(explores the markets with a view to working up business in unexpected) Tj T*
(quarters, and having a series of chats with as many of his old friends) Tj T*
(as he may happen to meet. The only important duty of a dull day is) Tj T*
(luncheon, which may possibly include fifty up at billiards. When the) Tj T*
(Central London Railway was first opened, a fashion set in of lunching in) Tj T*
