(The afternoon passes quickly, or seems to do so, from the fact that the) Tj T*
(Stock Exchange closes promptly at four o'clock. One of the most) Tj T*
(remarkable developments of recent years in the Stock Exchange system is) Tj T*
(the extension of private telephones, and these wires play a most) Tj T*
(important part in the broker's life of the present day, especially) Tj T*
(during the afternoon. Not that the wires are entirely confined to) Tj T*
(brokers, but they, of course, have far more use for them than jobbers,) Tj T*
