(more limited circle. The broker's necessities in this direction are) Tj T*
(bounded only by his clients and their importance. Numbers of flourishing) Tj T*
(firms owe no small part of their success in business life to their) Tj T*
(enterprise in the direction of private telephone wires to individual) Tj T*
(clients, and the great landlords in the neighbourhood of the House have) Tj T*
(been quick to seize the opportunity which presents itself for getting) Tj T*
(big rents for small premises. The Stock Exchange Managers themselves are) Tj T*
(well to the front in the arena of competition, and between г100 and г200) Tj T*
(a year is demanded for the rent of one small room and telephone close to) Tj T*
(Capel Court. By this means a broker and his client are in constant touch) Tj T*
(with one another--much more so than would be the case if the general) Tj T*
(telephone alone had to be relied upon--and a fair proportion of the day) Tj T*
