(it is said, feels more tolerant, more disposed to increase his price if) Tj T*
(the shares he wants to buy are not obtainable at his original limit,) Tj T*
(more disposed to accept a fraction less if his first selling order) Tj T*
(should have proved at an impracticably high price.) Tj T*
