(from the New York Stock Exchange. In comparison with these, the Paris) Tj T*
(quotations that arrive about noon are uninteresting, and the American) Tj T*
(Market grows into a surging crowd between three o'clock and a) Tj T*
(quarter-past. It is often remarked upon as singular that no official) Tj T*
(prices are sent over from Wall Street; the arbitrage firms who deal) Tj T*
