(Other publications besides those mentioned in a previous chapter) Tj T*
(frequently emanate from the Stock Exchange, but these are not, as a) Tj T*
(rule, of an official character, nor even of a business character. The) Tj T*
(members at times lay down their dealing books and pencils to turn to) Tj T*
(literature of a more generally popular order. They have produced many a) Tj T*
(book, mainly in the cause of charity. Such, for instance, is "The House) Tj T*
(Annual," recently inaugurated. This is a sumptuously produced volume of) Tj T*
(light stories, sketches, and articles, handsomely illustrated. It is) Tj T*
