(leave to play.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The institution has its own Orchestral and Choral Society of about 200) Tj T*
(members, which has been established twenty years, gives a series of) Tj T*
(subscription concerts each season, and is quite an acknowledged factor) Tj T*
(in the musical world. There is an Art Society, also a Christian) Tj T*
