(the Christian attribute of charity the members of the Stock Exchange as) Tj T*
(a body are ever to the fore. Beginning at home, there is a Benevolent) Tj T*
(Fund as old as the Stock Exchange itself, for the benefit of members who) Tj T*
(fall upon troublous times. It has a capital of nearly a quarter of a) Tj T*
(million sterling, and an annual income which, although it varies in) Tj T*
